em out right now and stuck  between kaido and the red scabbards it's  not that crazy that he decided to take  his chances with the scabbards but he  definitely underestimated them orochi  mentions kanjuro which must infuriate  the scabbards all the more and i love  seeing how nervous and sweating he is  compared to the stoic faces of the  scabbards who honestly view him more as  an inconvenience than their goal  which is pretty much the ultimate insult  anyway this is it  orochi transforms into the 8 headed  serpent and from the looks  of it together the scabbards managed to  cut all the heads at the same time  what sweet revenge especially because  after they cut all his heads off  denjiro says we don't have time to waste  on the likes of you  again i'm not certain how the mythical  zone fruit works but it would make much  more sense for this to be orochi's end  than the kaido moment because now this  part of the prophecy has been fulfilled  and because he transformed they managed  to get  all the heads rather than just one it's  a nice needed moment for the scabbards  showing that this wasn't for nothing  and they've already made progress  towards their goal it also seems like a  fitting  not to mention hilarious and for orochi  to come back from the dead as if he's  going to make some big and dramatic  difference  only to be sent off again just as  quickly by the so-called ghosts that  haunted his thoughts for  20 years and then we get an interesting  ninja showdown set up between rhizo and  fukurokuju as they both continue  to show devotion to their so-called dead  fools  orochi and odin respectively fukurokuju  says they were fated to clash and so we  get the setup for a potentially  naruto-esque fight  where we'll get to see some fun ninja  techniques  this is definitely a matchup that makes  a lot of sense but it's hard to believe  how many matchups  oda has created in this war honestly  i can't see this arc being over anytime  soon with everything that still needs to  be wrapped up  then we jump to the most hyped part of  this chapter  and it's mind-blowing stuff guys we  joined the main event on the roof big  mom suggests a combined attack with  kaido  and we all freak out on the inside how  hype is that  a yonko combo move big mom hypes the  power of this attack even more by saying  and i quote i wonder how many of the  five will survive  end quote remember the goal was to  divide and conquer the supernova  want to separate the yonko but lost says  he can't send one of them away because  their haki is too strong  that makes sense and it's nice to get  that explanation from la himself so then  kid decides fine  we'll have to just tear them apart the  old-fashioned way the yonko prepared to  launch their combined attack and i  absolutely  love how they're trash talking each  other during the process kaido calling  her an old hag and big mom calling him a  brat  when zorro sees this combo attack he  says and i quote this is  insane and quote as if he's coming up  with the title for one of my one piece  chapter reviews  they won't be able to dodge so what  happens  and this is one of the craziest most  epic parts in the chapter  are boyz it completely sparing the  others from the  impact big mom wondered how many would  die and one supernova not even a captain  managed to block the attack without even  dying  wow zorro is just so  damn awesome however luffy won't let  zoro take all the glory and goes in to  attack kaido suddenly  allowing them to accomplish what they  wanted to to separate  big mom from kaido again i keep  mentioning this in the reviews but you  can really see  luffy standing out when compared to the  others as they are all  left to fight big mom together luffy  takes on the strongest creature on his  own it's not a 3-2 split but a 4-1  split which reinforces why luffy will be  the pirate king when compared to the  other epically cool worst generation  pirates  i love luffy's trash talk too kaido  dodges one of his moves and luffy is  loving it he smiles asking kaido why  he's dodging before suggesting that it's  because  it would hurt the dude is having so much  fun as he fights the strongest creature  in the world  however luffy does pay for taking on  kaido by himself and kaido unleashes  powerful combos  and finishes it off with three realms  ragnarok which looks destructive and  damaging af  i wouldn't be too worried about luffy  even if it looks bad  sure kaido is winning but luffy is  succeeding in distracting him  giving the others a better chance to  deal with big mom and oh boy  do they deal with big mom although law  can't transport big mom using his powers  he can transport her homies he traps  zeus in a cube kid created  then another testament to the sheer  legendariness of zorro he is not only up  after taking that block  he goes on to cut prometheus sending big  mom falling to the ground  even though i'm already such a zorro  fanboy i continue to be blown away by  him  time after time it's nice seeing killer  play a part 2  as he chases napoleon after separating  big mom from her homies  they have a better chance but big mom  just thinks it's silly that they think  getting rid of them the homies would  make a difference  but they are counting on strategy rather  than strength kid shines here and i've  been waiting for this moment  he takes a punch from big mom but  manages to use his powers after grabbing  big mom with his metal arm to repel her  high up in the air  la proceeds to send a giant boulder at  her  which sends her flying big mom is not  amused that will only slow her down a  bit  but do no real damage however what she  doesn't realize until it's too late  is that she's been pushed right off the  flying island big mom is panicking big  time as she drops while there's nothing  but ocean below  she's crying out for zeus's help but  he's trapped and he can't help  they tell her it's time for her to drop  out and as a cultured man who  appreciates puns  i gotta say nice one zorro seems in pain  but they appear to have done it they  appear  to have found a way to defeat a yonko as  far as this fight is concerned now is it  possible  and even probable that big mom will be  saved in some way whether by kaido or  someone else  yeah totally but that should not take  away from the epicness of this  effort these guys did a great job here  and if by some chance  all five get some time to team up  against kaido  that would definitely increase their  chances a lot remains to be seen  like how hurt exactly are luffy and  zorro  but i'm pretty confident it's usual  shonen injuries that won't actually mean  too much  in the long run even if they look bad  whatever happens this was the best  chapter in a while and the most hyped  and exciting one for me personally  i cannot wait for next week as usual let  me know your thoughts  on this chapter and what you look  forward to seeing the most in the next  one  if you do enjoy these one-piece reviews  and want to keep them coming the best  thing you can do is smash that like  button until it's blue  if you haven't be sure to subscribe and  this is crucial hit that notification  bell  and select all or you will miss future  one piece videos  and while you wait for the next chapter  to drop which  will be next week feel free to check out  my growing one piece playlist which  includes videos on all yonko  supernova warlords and much more link to  that  is in the description and i especially  want to thank the patron squad over on  patreon and here on youtube who helped  make videos like this one possible  first and foremost i want to thank the  patron of legend the one acknowledged by  lord wigo himself  and the most donated champion of the  world alpha sigma  and are the one tier patrons the ones  who stand atop all clans  in grata acquire respect pate heffa liam  thompson algertol  dr cortman scarlet the toasted chi  bang emperor taku spidey life tinel  baked buddhist tung